{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-5071","title":{"zh":"解码彩色语言","en":"Deciphering Colorful Language"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","start":"first_contact.5071","chapters":3,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"通过运用十六进制数位系统，我们的数学家和[This.Owner.GetLinguists]几乎就快要破译[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的色彩语言了。官方也正在起草第一次接触协议。\n\n通过对[This.ContactCountry.GetName]语言的研究，我们发现他们的文化包罗万象，而且沟通上产生误解的可能性非常高。现在我们必须决定沟通的方针究竟是倾向于他们的逻辑型还是偏向他们的情感表达……","en":"By utilizing a hexadecimal positional numeral system, our mathematicians and [This.Owner.GetLinguists] are on the verge of a colorful language breakthrough with the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]. Officials are preparing first contact protocols.\n\nThrough studyi"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact.5071","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":["n2","n3"]},"n2":{"doc":"first_contact.5072","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"first_contact.5071.A","optionIndex":0,"modified":true,"chance":0.6667,"group":"r13217","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_events.txt:9031"},"children":[]},"n3":{"doc":"first_contact.5073","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"first_contact.5071.A","optionIndex":0,"modified":true,"chance":0.3333,"group":"r13217","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_events.txt:9048"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.5071","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"解码彩色语言","en":"Deciphering Colorful Language"},"texts":[{"zh":"通过运用十六进制数位系统，我们的数学家和[This.Owner.GetLinguists]几乎就快要破译[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的色彩语言了。官方也正在起草第一次接触协议。\n\n通过对[This.ContactCountry.GetName]语言的研究，我们发现他们的文化包罗万象，而且沟通上产生误解的可能性非常高。现在我们必须决定沟通的方针究竟是倾向于他们的逻辑型还是偏向他们的情感表达……","en":"By utilizing a hexadecimal positional numeral system, our mathematicians and [This.Owner.GetLinguists] are on the verge of a colorful language breakthrough with the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]. Officials are preparing first contact protocols.\n\nThrough studying the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] language, we know their culture is vast. The potential risk for misunderstanding is high. Now we must decide if we should appeal to their sense of logic, or to their emotions..."},{"zh":"通过运用十六进制数位系统，我们几乎就要破译[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的色彩语言了。第一次接触协议也正在起草中。\n\n我们现在可以选择通过富有文化特质的问候来取悦他们的情感或是尝试进行一种更复杂的但高效的表达方式。","en":"By utilizing a hexadecimal positional numeral system, the collective is on the verge of a colorful language breakthrough with the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]. We are preparing first contact protocols.\n\nWe can now either pander to their emotions with a culturally significant greeting, or we can attempt a more complex protocol to increase potential efficiency."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.5071.A","label":{"zh":"用音乐与他们打招呼吧！","en":"Contact them in song!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"我们会尝试与[This.ContactCountry.GetName]建立情感联系。","en":"We will attempt to forge an emotional connection with the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]."}],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.5072","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","chance":0.6667,"group":"r13217","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"modified":true,"source":"events/first_contact_events.txt:9031","story":"event-first-contact-5071"},{"target":"first_contact.5073","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","chance":0.3333,"group":"r13217","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"modified":true,"source":"events/first_contact_events.txt:9048","story":"event-first-contact-5071"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"first_contact.5071.B","label":{"zh":"在交流中避免情绪化。","en":"Keep the emotion out of it."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c13220","when":[[[{"type"